格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A plugin for editing global rules in the DeepSeek Harness Web settings panel.","id":"gh:1334723614","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-global-rules","slug":"badai147/dsh-global-rules","topics":["ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","global-rules","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A plugin for editing global rules in the DeepSeek Harness Web settings panel."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-global-rules"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Edit your user-global rules file `$DSH_HOME/AGENTS.md` (default `~/.dsh/AGENTS.md`) from the DeepSee"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"k Harness web settings panel."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- A new **Global rules** settings tab (labelled 「全局规则」): opening it loads the current content of the"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" global rules file and shows the path it resolved to\n- Path resolution matches the harness: a non-bl"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ank `$DSH_HOME` wins, otherwise `~/.dsh` (the same rule the built-in `dsh-agent-instructions` follow"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"s, so you always edit the file that is actually in effect)\n- Edit and save with immediate effect: **"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"new sessions** use the new rules on their first step; the current session picks them up after its ne"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"xt file operation (handled by DSH's built-in `dsh-agent-instructions` change detection)\n- Saving cre"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ates the file when it does not exist yet\n- Zero build: the client half is a hand-written `__ModuleLo"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"ader__` bundle, the host half is plain Node ESM"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) with the `web` profile\n- No extra runtime dependency: the plugin ships on"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ly `lib/`, `cordis.patch.yml`, `icon.svg`, and\n`locale/*.json`"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Installing from the GitHub source (alternative):"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then open **Settings → Global rules**."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. Open Settings → Global rules\n2. Edit the rules (Markdown, the same syntax as `AGENTS.md`)\n3. Clic"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ttings → Global rules\n2. Edit the rules (Markdown, the same syntax as `AGENTS.md`)\n3. Click **Save**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"After saving:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- New sessions read the new content on their first step, so it applies immediately\n- The current ses"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"sion: after the next filesystem tool call, DSH detects the change and injects\n\"Updated instructions "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"from: ~/.dsh/AGENTS.md\", and the model follows the new rules"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **Host** (`lib/index.js`): registers the exact Fetch route `GET/POST /api/global-rules` through `c"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"tx.connection.fetch.register` (read the file / write the file, 256 KiB limit). It rides Connection's"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" `/api` channel, so it lands inside the Host/Origin fence and browser authentication with no hand-ro"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"lled same-origin check\n- **Client** (`lib/client.js`): a hand-written `window.__ModuleLoader__.load`"},{"id":"p19s5","text":" bundle that registers the **Global rules** page under `settings.section`\n- **Effect mechanism**: DS"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"H's built-in `dsh-agent-instructions` plugin covers dynamic detection for the `user-global` scope, s"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"o this plugin needs no hot-reload of its own"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Project structure"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Changelog"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Release notes live in CHANGELOG.md (中文)."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Bug reports, feature requests, and pull requests are welcome — see CONTRIBUTING.md\n(中文) for the deve"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"lopment setup, project conventions, and commit rules."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
